/**
 * Official Survey of India Boundary Data & Exact Geodetic Projection
 * Generated from authentic Survey of India administrative boundary coordinates.
 * Includes complete Jammu & Kashmir, Ladakh, Arunachal Pradesh, Andaman & Nicobar, and Lakshadweep.
